%% references_upgrades.bib
%% Drop-in replacements for entries in references.bib, under their EXISTING
%% keys, so they can be substituted one for one without touching any \cite.
%% references.bib itself is NOT modified by this file.
%%
%% Three kinds of change are made, each flagged per entry:
%%   [PUB]     preprint -> archival published version (venue, pages, DOI)
%%   [DOI]     DOI added to an already-correct entry
%%   [AUTHORS] "and others" replaced with the complete author list
%%   [FIX]     a factual error in the existing entry corrected
%%
%% Every entry was checked against a named record: the Crossref REST API
%% (api.crossref.org), the DBLP publication API (dblp.org/search/publ/api),
%% the ACL Anthology BibTeX export (aclanthology.org/<id>.bib), or the arXiv
%% API (export.arxiv.org/api/query). The source is given per entry.
%%
%% NOT INCLUDED, deliberately:
%%   ghosh2025event  -- could not be verified at all; see the report. Do not
%%                      substitute anything for it until it is resolved.
%%   raglab2024repo, selfrag2023repo -- software repositories; an organisation
%%                      or project as author is correct, so they are left alone.
%%   huggingface2024agents, flashrag2025repo -- same, left alone.


